<p>The <code>TaskListItem</code> represents one step in a
  <a href="/components/task-list/"><code>TaskList</code></a>. The
  <code>status</code> param controls the visual state:
  <code>completed</code>, <code>in-progress</code>,
  <code>not-started</code>, or <code>cannot-start-yet</code>.</p>

<p>See the <a href="/components/task-list/">TaskList demo</a> for
  the composed example.</p>

{# BEGIN generated: examples (bin/generate-examples) #}
<h2>Usage</h2>
<pre tabindex="0"><code>{% raw %}&lt;TaskList label="Today's tasks"&gt;
  &lt;TaskListItem completed={true}&gt;Review pull requests&lt;/TaskListItem&gt;
  &lt;TaskListItem&gt;Update documentation&lt;/TaskListItem&gt;
  &lt;TaskListItem&gt;Deploy to staging&lt;/TaskListItem&gt;
&lt;/TaskList&gt;
{% endraw %}</code></pre>
